        <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-palm-900/10 bg-sand-50 p-6"><dt class="text-sm font-black text-gold-600">Rest points</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black text-palm-900"><bdi dir="ltr">{PARK.perimeterWalkwayRestPoints}</bdi> points</dd><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-palm-900/65">With <bdi dir="ltr">{PARK.perimeterWalkwayAccessibleRamps}</bdi> ramps adapted for people with disabilities.</p></div>
